      <marc:subfield code="a">Danny Cartwright and Spencer Craig never should have met. One evening‚ Danny‚ an East End garage mechanic takes his girlfriend up to the West End to celebrate their engagement. He crosses paths with Spencer Craig‚ a barrister poised to become the youngest Queen&apos;s Counsel of his generation. A few hours later‚ Danny is arrested for murder and later sentenced to 22 years in prison‚ thanks to testimony from Spencer Craig‚ the prosecution&apos;s main witness. Danny spends the next few years in the high-security Belmarsh prison while Spencer Craig’s career syrockets. All the while‚ he plans for the day he can extract his revenge</marc:subfield>
